graph TD
    %% Cell Lineage Signal
    A[Cell Division Event] --> B[Mother vs Daughter Fate]
    B --> C{Mother Cell?}
    
    %% Mother Cell Path
    C -->|Yes| D[No Ash1p in Nucleus]
    D --> E[HO Promoter Accessible]
    
    %% Daughter Cell Path  
    C -->|No| F[Ash1p Delivered to Daughter]
    F --> G[Ash1p Nuclear Localization]
    G --> H[Ash1p Binds HO URS1]
    H --> I[\HO Transcription Repressed/]
    I --> J[No Mating Type Switch in Daughter]
    
    %% Cell Cycle Checkpoint
    K[G1 Phase Entry] --> L[Cln3-Cdc28 Activity]
    L --> M[SBF Activation]
    M --> N[Swi4-Swi6 Complex]
    N --> O{In G1 Phase?}
    
    %% Not G1 - No HO
    O -->|No| P[\HO URS2 Inactive/]
    P --> Q[No HO Expression]
    
    %% G1 YES Path
    O -->|Yes| R[SBF Binds HO URS2]
    
    %% AND Gate 1: Mother Cell AND G1
    E --> ANDGATE1{Mother Cell AND<br/>G1 Phase?}
    R --> ANDGATE1
    ANDGATE1 -->|Yes| S[Chromatin Remodeling]
    ANDGATE1 -->|No| Q
    
    %% SWI/SNF Complex Activation
    S --> T[SWI/SNF Recruitment]
    T --> U[Nucleosome Displacement]
    U --> V[HO Promoter Opened]
    V --> W[Swi5p Binds HO URS1]
    W --> X[Basal Transcription Complex]
    
    %% AND Gate 2: Chromatin Open AND Swi5p
    V --> ANDGATE2{Chromatin Open AND<br/>Swi5p Bound?}
    W --> ANDGATE2
    ANDGATE2 -->|Yes| Y[RNA Pol II Recruitment]
    ANDGATE2 -->|No| Q
    
    %% HO Gene Expression
    Y --> Z[HO mRNA Synthesis]
    Z --> AA[HO mRNA Export]
    AA --> AB[HO Translation]
    AB --> AC[HO Endonuclease Protein]
    
    %% DNA Cleavage
    AC --> AD[HO Nuclear Import]
    AD --> AE[HO Recognizes MAT Locus]
    AE --> AF[Double-Strand Break at MAT]
    
    %% Mating Type Information
    AG[HML Silent Cassette] --> AH[MATa or MATalpha Info]
    AI[/HMR Silent Cassette/] --> AJ[MATalpha or MATa Info]
    
    %% Gene Conversion Decision
    AF --> AK{Current Mating<br/>Type?}
    AK -->|MATa| AL[Copy from HMR]
    AK -->|MATalpha| AM[Copy from HML]
    
    %% Homologous Recombination
    AL --> AN[Rad51 Filament Formation]
    AM --> AN
    AJ --> AN
    AH --> AN
    AN --> AO[Homology Search]
    AO --> AP[/Strand Invasion/]
    AP --> AQ[DNA Synthesis]
    AQ --> AR[Gene Conversion]
    
    %% Mating Type Change
    AR --> AS[New MAT Allele]
    AS --> AT[Mating Type Switch Complete]
    AT --> AU{New Type?}
    AU -->|Now a| AV[a-Cell Identity]
    AU -->|Now alpha| AW[alpha-Cell Identity]
    
    %% Cellular Consequences
    AV --> AX[a-Specific Gene Expression]
    AW --> AY[alpha-Specific Gene Expression]
    AX --> AZ[Can Mate with alpha]
    AY --> BA[Can Mate with a]
    AZ --> BB[Diploid Formation Competent]
    BA --> BB
    J --> BC[Maintains Daughter Identity]
    Q --> BD[No Switch This Cycle]
    
